            "review_title": "Review at Tre",
            "review_text": "Helloieat\n1 contribution\n0\nI was told to go here.\nJun 2013\nI met some Vietnamese girls at a bar. We talked and soon found out one spoke pretty good English. We told her how we found the bar on trip advisor. She said oh you should try my friends restaurant. It is new and it is really good. She gave me the business card and couple of days later we tried it. It was good. I didnt know Vietnamese but the waiter somehow helped me pick a vegetarian dish. I told her she should add the restaurant on here and looks like she did. I would recommend coming here. It seems like there is a good mix of locals and tourists dining here.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten June 15, 2013",
