            "review_title": "Review at Tre",
            "review_text": "Travelsnobbress\nHouston, Texas1 contribution\n0\nAuthentic\nJun 2013\nIt just opened in May. This restaurant is family owned and they are very often in the kitchen making the food for you. The waiters don't all speak English but the menu is in English so ordering will not be a problem. Some of the best pho bo! Good value and service with a clean atmosphere. Just down the street from the intercontinental hotel.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten June 14, 2013",
